  "description": "Production-grade .NET framework for the Polish National e-Invoicing System (KSeF): fluent invoice query/build/send, UPO delivery receipts, certificate handling, retry policy, XAdES signing, exception taxonomy, diagnostics, and Source Link. Self-contained protocol implementation under `KsefKit.Protocol.*` — consumers restore from nuget.org only (no private GitHub Packages feed). Runs on .NET Framework 4.6.2+ (including net48/net481), .NET Core 2.0+, and .NET 5-10.",
